#. module: sign_itsme
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sign_itsme
msgid ""
"Add support for itsme® identification when signing documents (Belgium and "
"Netherlands only)"
msgstr ""

#. module: sign_itsme
#: model:iap.service,description:sign_itsme.iap_service_itsme_proxy
msgid ""
"Ask document signatories in Odoo Sign to provide their identity using the "
"itsme® identity platform. By combining Odoo Sign with itsme®️, you can add an "
"identification step in your signature flows and ask signatories to provide "
"their identity through the itsme®️ platform, using their mobile device. "
"Available in Belgium and in the Netherlands."
msgstr ""
"Demandez aux signataires de documents dans Odoo Signature de fournir leur "
"identité via la plateforme d'identité itsme®️. En combinant Odoo Signature "
"avec itsme®️, vous pouvez ajouter une étape d'identification dans vos flux de "
"signature et demander aux signataires de fournir leur identité via la "
"plateforme itsme®️, en utilisant leur appareil mobile. Disponible en Belgique "
"et aux Pays-Bas."

